'''Skeleton Mages''' are a rare variant of [[skeleton]] that make use of [[Magic]] to attack. Thus, it is recommended to wear magic-resistant armour such as [[dragonhide armour]]. They play a role in the [[Swan Song]] [[quest]], where the player creates an army of them to help defeat the [[sea troll]]s.

{{Listen|align=right|title=I infect your body with rot...|filename=Skeleton Mage Weaken.ogg|desc=The sound when a Skeleton Mage successfully weakens a player.}}
Level 16 mages usually attack with [[melee]] and will occasionally cast a spell, exclaiming {{overhead|I infect your body with rot...}} that resembles [[Weaken]] as a projectile and [[Curse]] when it lands successfully. If successful, it will lower the player's [[Attack]], [[Strength]] and [[Defence]] stats by 3-4 levels.

Level 83 mages cast a spell that resembles [[Fire Strike]] and will sometimes use [[Vulnerability]] on the player.

[[Malignius Mortifer]] will occasionally spawn a non-attackable Skeleton Mage, which follows him around for a while before disappearing. The player can also summon their [[Skeleton Mage (Bone Seed)|own variant]] using [[Bone seeds]] after the completion of [[Swan Song]].

